WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.352
O wi'i: "Naa' saa'i ɗum, yimɓe ɓillaaɓe ɗon ɗaɓɓita ndiyam nder lesdi.

00:00:05.432 --> 00:00:07.990
Ɓe mbi'i, "Ɗu'um woni liƴƴi ɗi'i".

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:13.810
Ngam faamugo ɓe, worɓe ɓeen mbi'i ɓe mbaawataa waɗugo ɓe kooɗume halleende.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:17.845
Diga saa'i maajum, alkawal ngal ɗum hokki yimɓe fuu.
